.TH ROFI-CALENDAR 1 "rofi-hub 0.2.1" "rofi-hub" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rofi-calendar \- month sheet with a date search box for Rofi
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rofi-calendar
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rofi-calendar
shows a month grid in Rofi. Enter on a day or on the today button opens the
selected date with the system handler. Typing a date jumps to it.
.PP
Accepted search forms are
.BR 15 ,
.BR 15/3 ,
.BR 3/2027 ,
.BR 15/3/2027 ,
and
.BR 2027-03-15 .
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B Left / Right
Browse months.
.TP
.B Ctrl+t
Return to today.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ROFI_BIN
Rofi executable. Defaults to
.BR rofi .
.TP
.B ROFI_CONFIG
Explicit Rofi configuration file.
.TP
.B ROFI_THEME
Theme override. Otherwise
.I ~/.config/rofi/calendar.rasi
and the system data directories are searched.
.TP
.B ROFI_CALENDAR_TODAY
Pin "today" to a
.I YYYY-MM-DD
date. Intended for tests.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero on success or cancel; non-zero when Rofi cannot be started.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rofi-hub (1),
.BR rofi (1)
